<div class="guide-styles" data-ay-injected="true" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Assassination Rogue DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 4. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Assassination Rogue DPS Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>With access to increased difficulty and increased loot in Titan Rune Gamma heroic dungeons, you can get some pretty powerful gear before stepping into raids in Phase 4. While you certainly don't <i>need</i> everything here before going to your first raid, this list should be helpful to know what the best Pre-Raid option is in each slot for your Assassination rogue.<br/>
<br/>For a Assassination rogue you will want to maintain at least 237 hit rating for your poison hit cap and 214 expertise rating for expertise cap. Poisons are a big part of your damage and reaching your poison hit cap is very important. Remember it is okay to be over your poison hit cap because excess hit rating still provides a DPS increase by making your auto attacks land more often. Expertise cap is different and any expertise beyond the cap provides no benefit at all to your character.<br/>
<br/>
