<br/>
<br/>Almost all of the items on this list are purchased with either <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> from Titan Rune Beta dungeons or <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2711/defilers-scourgestone">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_bone_skull_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Defiler's Scourgestone</span></span></a> from Titan Rune Gamma dungeons. The Sidereal Essences are earned one per dungeon off the last boss of each Titan Rune Beta dungeon you complete. The Defiler's Scourgestones are earned one per boss, from every boss in every Titan Rune Gamma dungeon you complete. You can "trade down" one Defiler's Scourgestone into one Sidereal Essence, so you can stay in Titan Rune Gamma dungeons all the time if you want to.<br/>
<br/>For the Tier 9 armor pieces <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-151/triumphant-garonas-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant Garona's Battlegear</span></a> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_horde.gif");'></span> /<wbr/> <a data-entity="item-set" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item-set=-150/triumphant-vancleefs-battlegear">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Triumphant VanCleef's Battlegear</span></a> <span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/side_alliance.gif");'></span>, you will need to buy a <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47242/trophy-of-the-crusade">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_trophy_argent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Trophy of the Crusade</span></a> from the Defiler's Scourgestone vendor for 20 Defiler's Scourgestones. The Trophy combined with many <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> can be exchanged for the armor pieces.<br/>
<br/>A lot of the items in this list have different names on Alliance and on Horde. The gear embed above shows the Horde item names. In the list below you can see both the Alliance and Horde items names.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-list">Assassination Rogue DPS Best in Slot Gear List - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
